msgid "UTF-8 with its mark"
msgstr "UTF-8 avec BOM"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:252
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Western (one byte a letter)"
msgstr "Occidental (un octet par lettre)"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:253
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"%s · %s line ends · %d lines · %s. Saved as it was: the same encoding and "
"line ends. A game reads it at its next start."
msgstr ""
"%s · fins de ligne %s · %d lignes · %s. Enregistré tel quel : même "
"encodage et mêmes fins de ligne. Le jeu le lit à son prochain démarrage."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:255
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Fermer"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:263
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Enregistré."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:271
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Close without saving the changes?"
msgstr "Fermer sans enregistrer les modifications ?"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:276
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Wine writes its .reg files while a game plays: change them only when no "
"game is running."
msgstr ""
"Wine écrit ses fichiers .reg pendant qu'un jeu tourne : modifiez-les "
"seulement quand aucun jeu n'est lancé."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
